      "source": "Variant of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/support/ServletContextAwareProcessor.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context.support\"><code>ServletContextAwareProcessor</code></a> for use with a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/ConfigurableWebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>ConfigurableWebApplicationContext</code></a>. Can be used when registering the processor\ncan occur before the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletContext</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://jakarta.ee/specifications/platform/11/apidocs/jakarta/servlet/ServletConfig.html\" title=\"class or interface in jakarta.servlet\"><code>ServletConfig</code></a> have been\ninitialized.",
